{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31965","headline":"雨夜寄马戴 · 贾岛","name":"雨夜寄马戴","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"芳林杏花树，花落子西东。\n今夕曲江雨，寒催朔北风。\n乡书沧海绝，隐路翠微通。\n寂寂相思际，孤釭残漏中。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"贾岛","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_31965.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31965","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}